# `CHART-LEVEL-KEY`: `chart level=` is DELETED, not renamed. Zero uses
# corpus-wide, zero 3-D bar charts, zero requests; it was the only construct
# whose caption the ENGINE wrote rather than the author, and its `parseFloat`
# grammar uniquely accepted `1e3`, breaking the otherwise-uniform numeric
# grammar. The key stays REGISTERED as retired so the deletion gets a named
# message instead of the generic `unknown option "level="`.
